{% comment %}
@description: Khung bao ngoai moi trang — <head> (title/meta/JSON-LD SEO), goi header/footer, cho block content chen vao giua.
@required_substrings: {% block content %}{% endblock %}, cdn.tailwindcss.com, pageTitle, {% render "header", {% render "footer", {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", {% render "components/common/cart-drawer", /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css, /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.js
@required_ids:
@notes: BAT BUOC dung <title>{{ pageTitle | default: site.siteName }}</title> - MOI route (blog.ts/pages.ts/products.ts...) tinh rieng pageTitle/metaDescription/noindex/schemas cho tung trang, neu layout chi hardcode site.siteName thi MOI TRANG se co cung 1 title, mat het SEO rieng tung trang (loi that da gap o theme leadbase). PHAI giu <meta name="description"> khi co metaDescription, <meta name="robots" content="noindex"> khi noindex truthy, va vong lap {% for schema in schemas %}<script type="application/ld+json">{{ schema | json }}</script>{% endfor %} (schemas la array object thuong, filter "json" co san trong LiquidJS mac dinh, KHONG can tu dang ky). PHAI giu nguyen script Tailwind CDN (co the doi query plugin), PHAI giu {% block content %}{% endblock %} de noi dung tung trang chen vao, PHAI goi {% render "header", site: site, headerMenu: headerMenu %} va {% render "footer", site: site, footerMenu: footerMenu, year: year %}, PHAI giu {% render "components/common/breadcrumb", ... %} o trong layout de breadcrumb hien toan site khi route truyen breadcrumbs, PHAI goi {% render "components/common/cart-drawer" %} ngay truoc the dong body, PHAI giu the <link> toi /theme-assets/{{ themeSlug }}/assets/custom.css va <script> toi .../custom.js (CSS/JS tuy bien rieng cua theme, sinh/sua o buoc khac). QUAN TRONG: neu goi them {% render "components/customer-chat" %}, PHAI truyen tay site: site, chatSessionId: chatSessionId, chatHmacToken: chatHmacToken - {% render %} cua LiquidJS co lap scope hoan toan (da kiem chung thuc te), KHONG tu ke thua bien global cua layout, thieu se lam avatar/session chat rong. Duoc tu do doi font (Google Fonts link), tailwind.config (mau sac, fontFamily), bo cuc <body> ngoai cac phan bat buoc tren.
{% endcomment %}

